297
00:15:26,240 --> 00:15:26,879
What?

298
00:15:29,120 --> 00:15:31,080
Gao Xuelin's father

299
00:15:31,240 --> 00:15:32,399
was Liu Xuemei's

300
00:15:33,000 --> 00:15:34,480
lover in Qingzhou.

301
00:15:34,639 --> 00:15:35,679
So what you're saying is,

302
00:15:36,759 --> 00:15:38,120
that cop named Gao

303
00:15:38,559 --> 00:15:40,000
