304
00:15:41,120 --> 00:15:42,120
Not just the tapes.

305
00:15:42,639 --> 00:15:43,919
He probably committed murder, too.

306
00:15:49,960 --> 00:15:51,120
Whether he killed anyone or not,

307
00:15:51,519 --> 00:15:52,399
