313
00:16:12,759 --> 00:16:13,919
That's terrifying.

314
00:16:15,519 --> 00:16:16,120
Master, Master.

315
00:16:16,279 --> 00:16:17,559
I've reached the rendezvous point.

316
00:16:18,000 --> 00:16:18,559
Please advise.

317
00:16:20,679 --> 00:16:21,240
Master, Master.

318
00:16:21,399 --> 00:16:22,679
