323
00:17:22,759 --> 00:17:24,440
Don't take your frustration out on the bed.

324
00:17:24,680 --> 00:17:25,279
Come on, will you?

325
00:17:25,279 --> 00:17:25,880
Say something.

326
00:17:25,880 --> 00:17:26,880
Fine, fine, that's enough.

327
00:17:29,599 --> 00:17:30,440
