382
00:19:16,359 --> 00:19:17,920
That's a deep grudge.

383
00:19:19,119 --> 00:19:19,960
Stealing true love,

384
00:19:20,000 --> 00:19:20,640
killing parents,

385
00:19:20,640 --> 00:19:21,920
Ma Guowen never had the guts for that.

386
00:19:22,000 --> 00:19:23,160
Ruining livelihood is up for debate.

387
00:19:24,400 --> 00:19:24,920
Investigate it.

388
00:19:25,039 --> 00:19:26,480
Follow that lead.

389
00:19:26,480 --> 00:19:27,079
Got it?

390
00:19:28,680 --> 00:19:28,960
Fine.

391
00:19:29,640 --> 00:19:30,079
Understood.

392
00:19:34,440 --> 00:19:35,960
Lying here these past few days,

393
00:19:36,079 --> 00:19:37,720
