I'll set up an investigation team

572
00:27:19,880 --> 00:27:21,279
specifically to look into this matter.

573
00:27:21,640 --> 00:27:22,920
The only thing you can do right now

574
00:27:23,400 --> 00:27:24,799
is cooperate with the department's inquiry.

575
00:27:26,160 --> 00:27:26,960
During this time,

576
00:27:27,279 --> 00:27:28,680
you cannot meet Shen Leshui alone.

577
00:27:30,599 --> 00:27:31,359
Not just her.

578
00:27:31,920 --> 00:27:33,319
Anyone from that public account,

579
00:27:33,759 --> 00:27:34,680
you're not allowed to see them.

580
00:27:36,160 --> 00:27:36,960
Regarding this matter,

581
00:27:37,160 --> 00:27:38,440
we must clear it up as soon as possible,

582
00:27:38,680 --> 00:27:39,680
and handle it with the utmost seriousness.

583
00:27:40,440 --> 00:27:40,839
Understood.

584
00:27:41,599 --> 00:27:42,400
Gao,

585
00:27:43,319 --> 00:27:44,240
the department's decision

586
00:27:44,680 --> 00:27:45,680
is for you to be suspended from duty for now.

587
00:27:46,519 --> 00:27:47,799
I can't be suspended!

588
00:27:48,759 --> 00:27:49,559
Captain Cheng,

589
00:27:50,039 --> 00:27:51,480
so many cases are still unsolved.

590
00:27:51,759 --> 00:27:53,319
My brother is lying in the hospital right now,

591
00:27:53,319 --> 00:27:54,599
and I should stop working?

592
00:27:56,200 --> 00:27:57,119
Clear this up quickly,

593
00:27:57,480 --> 00:27:58,680
and keep me updated at all times.

594
00:27:59,240 --> 00:27:59,920
Gao,

595
00:28:00,319 --> 00:28:01,240
doing this

596
00:28:01,400 --> 00:28:02,359
is also for your own good.

597
00:28:02,880 --> 00:28:03,920
I hope you can understand.

598
00:28:04,440 --> 00:28:05,279
Once it's cleared up,

599
00:28:05,799 --> 00:28:07,039
you'll be reinstated immediately.

600
00:28:10,359 --> 00:28:11,119
I understand then.

601
00:28:11,319 --> 00:28:11,759
All right, then.

602
00:28:15,839 --> 00:28:16,279
Recently,

603
00:28:16,680 --> 00:28:18,920
a series of bizarre murders shocked Lacheng.

604
00:28:19,319 --> 00:28:20,319
The finger of suspicion

605
00:28:20,319 --> 00:28:22,039
shockingly points to a police officer.

606
00:28:27,359 --> 00:28:27,960
Guo,

607
00:28:29,079 --> 00:28:30,200
when can I be discharged?

608
00:28:30,319 --> 00:28:31,079
Go ask for me.

609
00:28:31,599 --> 00:28:32,640
I have a ton of things to deal with out there.

610
00:28:32,640 --> 00:28:34,000
I'm already burning with anxiety.

611
00:28:34,200 --> 00:28:35,920
The doctor prescribed medicine to clear your internal heat.

612
00:28:36,039 --> 00:28:36,960
Please remember to take it.

613
00:28:37,039 --> 00:28:38,279
Meds won't help!

614
00:28:38,359 --> 00:28:38,839
Just ask...

615
00:28:38,839 --> 00:28:40,119
Ask them when I can be discharged,

616
00:28:40,160 --> 00:28:40,480
will you?

617
00:28:40,480 --> 00:28:41,640
Let me take your blood pressure again.

618
00:28:41,680 --> 00:28:43,200
It was normal all three times today!

619
00:28:43,200 --> 00:28:44,400
Don't—don't measure it.

620
00:28:44,440 --> 00:28:45,519
Put it away, please?

621
00:28:45,640 --> 00:28:46,440
Just ask for me...

622
00:28:50,119 --> 00:28:50,400
I'm sorry.

623
00:28:50,400 --> 00:28:51,519
I'm not taking it out on you, okay?

624
00:28:59,640 --> 00:29:00,400
Are you here

625
00:29:01,720 --> 00:29:02,920
because of Gao Xuelin?

626
00:29:04,640 --> 00:29:05,519
Has he been here?

627
00:29:06,960 --> 00:29:07,640
How could he come?

628
00:29:09,640 --> 00:29:11,279
He's probably under investigation right now.

629
00:29:12,119 --> 00:29:12,960
Just now,

630
00:29:14,119 --> 00:29:14,960
I checked your account,

631
00:29:15,480 --> 00:29:16,880
and it called him a murderer.

632
00:29:21,960 --> 00:29:22,920
Some of that footage

633
00:29:24,000 --> 00:29:24,880
was shot by me,

634
00:29:26,200 --> 00:29:26,839
but I didn't edit it,

635
00:29:26,839 --> 00:29:27,880
and I didn't post it.

636
00:29:28,960 --> 00:29:30,319
I do suspect him,

637
00:29:30,839 --> 00:29:32,759
but I'd never make things up just on suspicion.

638
00:29:33,119 --> 00:29:35,119
Gao Xuelin isn't the killer.

639
00:29:36,880 --> 00:29:38,279
The night I was attacked,

640
00:29:38,799 --> 00:29:40,039
Gao was at the station.

641
00:29:40,279 --> 00:29:41,359
There are witnesses.

642
00:29:42,279 --> 00:29:42,920
Then why does he

643
00:29:42,920 --> 00:29:44,640
keep fixating on Liu Xuemei?

644
00:29:45,119 --> 00:29:46,039
What's his dad's connection to Liu Xuemei?

645
00:29:46,039 --> 00:29:47,119
Leshui, that's for the police

646
00:29:47,119 --> 00:29:48,720
to investigate, all right?

647
00:29:52,240 --> 00:29:53,440
Investigating a case

648
00:29:54,160 --> 00:29:55,000
requires objective facts,

649
00:29:55,000 --> 00:29:56,480
not subjective assumptions.

650
00:29:57,240 --> 00:29:58,640
Yet some people choose to believe

651
00:29:58,759 --> 00:30:00,920
whatever confirms their preconceptions,

652
00:30:00,920 --> 00:30:02,799
while ignoring anything to the contrary.

653
00:30:04,400 --> 00:30:04,799
I...

654
00:30:07,279 --> 00:30:08,160
Never mind me.

655
00:30:08,559 --> 00:30:09,640
I'm just anxious.

656
00:30:10,440 --> 00:30:11,799
I didn't mean to lecture you.

657
00:30:15,039 --> 00:30:16,200
Gao has been suspended.

658
00:30:17,799 --> 00:30:18,599
Three cases.

659
00:30:19,319 --> 00:30:20,720
None of the three have been solved.

660
00:30:22,839 --> 00:30:24,079
It's on me.

661
00:30:28,960 --> 00:30:30,480
I got conned by a guy named Li Mingyang.

662
00:30:32,599 --> 00:30:33,880
After all these years,

663
00:30:35,440 --> 00:30:37,240
I really slipped up.

664
00:30:41,319 --> 00:30:42,240
What happened?

665
00:30:47,079 --> 00:30:47,640
Don't worry.

666
00:30:48,079 --> 00:30:50,000
I'll find a way to give you all an explanation.

667
00:31:43,680 --> 00:31:44,440
What are you doing?

668
00:31:46,359 --> 00:31:47,279
You fraud!

669
00:31:47,359 --> 00:31:48,480
You shameless jerk!

670
00:31:54,119 --> 00:31:54,799
Have you lost your mind?

671
00:31:54,839 --> 00:31:56,119
Why are you smashing my car?

672
00:31:56,480 --> 00:31:58,200
Stop smashing it! What's wrong with you?

673
00:31:59,839 --> 00:32:00,519
Who is this woman?

674
00:32:00,720 --> 00:32:01,440
Is she crazy?

675
00:32:02,000 --> 00:32:02,759
Why smash the car?

676
00:32:02,759 --> 00:32:03,720
Are you out of your mind?

677
00:32:04,240 --> 00:32:05,160
Stop smashing it!

678
00:32:05,359 --> 00:32:06,000
Stop it!

679
00:32:06,359 --> 00:32:07,200
You're crazy!

680
00:32:07,759 --> 00:32:10,119
Li Mingyang, stop playing innocent with me!

681
00:32:10,200 --> 00:32:11,160
Why don't you tell everyone...

682
00:32:11,160 --> 00:32:12,440
...that you've been moonlighting?

683
00:32:12,720 --> 00:32:13,559
Stop talking nonsense!

684
00:32:13,559 --> 00:32:14,640
Who's moonlighting?

685
00:32:14,880 --> 00:32:16,319
What the hell is wrong with you?

686
00:32:18,000 --> 00:32:18,960
You fraud!

687
00:32:19,359 --> 00:32:20,319
You stole my footage! Let go of me!

688
00:32:20,319 --> 00:32:20,759
I'm telling you!

689
00:32:20,759 --> 00:32:21,759
Edited it maliciously! Let go!

690
00:32:22,240 --> 00:32:23,759
You even posted it under my name!

691
00:32:24,240 --> 00:32:25,240
Slandering the police...

692
00:32:25,240 --> 00:32:26,200
how could you do that?

693
00:32:26,279 --> 00:32:27,480
Just wait until you end up in prison!

694
00:32:27,920 --> 00:32:29,920
I'm telling you, stop talking nonsense!

695
00:32:31,599 --> 00:32:32,519
What does this have to do with you?

696
00:32:32,680 --> 00:32:33,759
Stop right there!

697
00:32:38,359 --> 00:32:39,160
Hitting someone, are you?

698
00:32:39,400 --> 00:32:40,240
I'm calling the police!

699
00:32:40,680 --> 00:32:41,839
Go ahead, call them!

700
00:32:42,000 --> 00:32:43,559
Let the cops investigate you thoroughly!

701
00:32:43,680 --> 00:32:44,440
Call them, then!

702
00:32:44,839 --> 00:32:45,440
What police? Call them!

703
00:32:45,440 --> 00:32:46,079
Put your phones down, all of you!

704
00:32:46,079 --> 00:32:46,920
Call the police, everyone!

705
00:32:47,359 --> 00:32:47,839
Call them!

706
00:32:48,599 --> 00:32:49,640
Weren't you going to call the police?

707
00:32:49,880 --> 00:32:50,440
Call them! Put that down!

708
00:32:50,440 --> 00:32:51,400
Whoever doesn't call is a coward!

709
00:32:51,400 --> 00:32:52,039
What police? Go ahead and call!

710
00:32:52,039 --> 00:32:52,920
Put your phone down! Call them!

711
00:32:52,920 --> 00:32:53,680
You fraud! Don't call!

712
00:32:53,680 --> 00:32:55,039
You even dared to spread rumors about the cops!

713
00:32:55,039 --> 00:32:56,160
How impressive!

714
00:32:56,480 --> 00:32:57,039
Let go of me!

715
00:32:57,039 --> 00:32:58,559
I'm telling you, you've gone mad!

716
00:32:58,799 --> 00:33:00,119
You psycho!

717
00:33:00,519 --> 00:33:01,920
Li Mingyang, let me tell you!

718
00:33:02,359 --> 00:33:03,599
You won't get away with this!

719
00:33:03,640 --> 00:33:04,279
Let go!

720
00:33:04,599 --> 00:33:05,799
I said, you're out of your mind!

721
00:33:06,000 --> 00:33:07,920
Justice will definitely catch up with you!

722
00:33:08,079 --> 00:33:09,079
Just wait to rot in jail!

723
00:33:09,480 --> 00:33:10,720
What are you looking at? Break it up!

724
00:33:11,680 --> 00:33:12,720
Li Mingyang!

725
00:33:31,079 --> 00:33:31,799
Shen Leshui.

726
00:33:33,599 --> 00:33:34,200
That's me.

727
00:33:34,839 --> 00:33:35,440
Li Mingyang.

728
00:33:35,720 --> 00:33:36,160
Yes.

729
00:33:36,279 --> 00:33:37,000
This way, you two.

730
00:33:37,960 --> 00:33:38,440
Zhang,

731
00:33:38,920 --> 00:33:40,440
pull up the surveillance footage and let them see it.

732
00:33:49,519 --> 00:33:50,119
Alright.

733
00:33:50,240 --> 00:33:50,920
Tell me what happened.

734
00:33:52,319 --> 00:33:53,400
She smashed my car for no reason!

735
00:33:53,680 --> 00:33:54,799
No reason?

736
00:33:55,519 --> 00:33:57,359
He wrote the article framing Officer Gao!

737
00:33:57,480 --> 00:33:58,720
What makes you say I wrote it?

738
00:33:58,880 --> 00:33:59,720
Is my name on it?

739
00:33:59,960 --> 00:34:00,920
I gave that to the TV station!

740
00:34:00,920 --> 00:34:01,759
You stole it!

741
00:34:02,119 --> 00:34:02,759
Officers,

742
00:34:03,079 --> 00:34:04,319
framing a public official is a crime.

743
00:34:04,440 --> 00:34:05,960
Please uncover the truth

744
00:34:05,960 --> 00:34:06,880
and clear Officer Gao's name!

745
00:34:07,279 --> 00:34:08,320
Let me tell you, Shen Leshui,

746
00:34:08,480 --> 00:34:09,800
cut the good-guy act, will you?

747
00:34:09,920 --> 00:34:11,280
Didn't you give me that info?

748
00:34:11,800 --> 00:34:12,440
Officers,

749
00:34:12,559 --> 00:34:13,320
I have a contract.

750
00:34:13,519 --> 00:34:14,880
I hold the final editing rights.

751
00:34:15,079 --> 00:34:15,800
Without my permission,

752
00:34:15,840 --> 00:34:16,800
he had no right to publish it.

753
00:34:17,480 --> 00:34:18,039
Officer,

754
00:34:18,679 --> 00:34:20,000
she sold me that footage!

755
00:34:20,079 --> 00:34:21,320
Covering this story was her idea, too!

756
00:34:21,440 --> 00:34:22,079
I have a recording!

757
00:34:23,480 --> 00:34:24,159
A recording?

758
00:34:25,400 --> 00:34:26,079
When did you record me?

759
00:34:27,360 --> 00:34:28,360
Did you edit that, too?

760
00:34:29,000 --> 00:34:30,320
Why are you so obsessed with editing?

761
00:34:30,320 --> 00:34:31,519
Cutting video, cutting audio...

762
00:34:31,519 --> 00:34:32,360
Are you a crab or something?

763
00:34:32,559 --> 00:34:34,119
Stop talking out of your ass!

764
00:34:34,119 --> 00:34:34,719
Shen Leshui!

765
00:34:34,719 --> 00:34:35,679
First you framed Officer Gao,

766
00:34:35,679 --> 00:34:36,599
and now you're framing me?

767
00:34:36,599 --> 00:34:38,559
Me framing you? You're the framing expert!

768
00:34:38,679 --> 00:34:39,519
Let the police investigate! Me, framing you?

769
00:34:39,840 --> 00:34:40,519
What did I do?

770
00:34:40,639 --> 00:34:41,199
What did I do wrong?

771
00:34:41,199 --> 00:34:41,880
Hey, both of you! 100K News Guy!

772
00:34:41,880 --> 00:34:42,440
Am I wrong?

773
00:34:42,440 --> 00:34:43,280
Calm down, calm down. No,

774
00:34:43,480 --> 00:34:43,920
calm down!

775
00:34:44,840 --> 00:34:45,559
The two of you...

776
00:34:46,079 --> 00:34:47,400
One damaged someone's property,

777
00:34:47,400 --> 00:34:48,280
and the other got into a brawl.

778
00:34:48,360 --> 00:34:49,840
You've severely disrupted public security

779
00:34:49,840 --> 00:34:50,599
and social order.

780
00:34:51,039 --> 00:34:52,280
Neither of you seems remotely remorseful.

781
00:34:52,559 --> 00:34:53,719
How about finding a place to cool off

782
00:34:53,800 --> 00:34:54,280
and reflect on yourselves?

783
00:34:54,360 --> 00:34:55,320
He framed a cop! And he framed me!

784
00:34:55,960 --> 00:34:57,639
We're currently investigating the defamation.

785
00:34:58,920 --> 00:35:00,039
Until that's cleared up,

786
00:35:00,480 --> 00:35:01,280
neither of you is leaving.

787
00:35:01,880 --> 00:35:02,280
Zhang!

788
00:35:03,360 --> 00:35:03,880
Wait, Officer!

789
00:35:03,960 --> 00:35:05,039
-She framed me! -Calm down.

790
00:35:05,039 --> 00:35:06,440
-I had nothing to do with it! -Calm down.

791
00:35:06,559 --> 00:35:07,360
Calm down first.

792
00:35:07,360 --> 00:35:08,480
Reflect on your actions. Come on, follow me.

793
00:35:10,360 --> 00:35:10,920
Xiao Li,

794
00:35:11,519 --> 00:35:12,280
take him away first.

795
00:35:20,320 --> 00:35:21,639
As for the video on the public account,

796
00:35:21,800 --> 00:35:22,840
we've already investigated it.

797
00:35:26,800 --> 00:35:28,159
We checked the surveillance footage in the neighborhood.

798
00:35:29,440 --> 00:35:30,320
It proves that

799
00:35:30,480 --> 00:35:32,920
Gao Xuelin was on regular duty that night.

800
00:35:33,880 --> 00:35:35,119
Judging by the timeline,

801
00:35:35,519 --> 00:35:36,559
the person he was chasing

802
00:35:36,760 --> 00:35:38,760
is very likely the one who stole your tape.

803
00:35:41,320 --> 00:35:42,519
I misjudged him.

804
00:35:44,320 --> 00:35:46,400
Disturbing public order has been cleared up,

805
00:35:46,800 --> 00:35:49,079
but the smear campaign against the police hasn't.

806
00:35:49,400 --> 00:35:50,119
You can't leave yet.

807
00:35:50,800 --> 00:35:51,760
What do you mean?

808
00:35:52,039 --> 00:35:53,519
You gave the footage to Li Mingyang,

809
00:35:53,719 --> 00:35:54,679
but the one who published it

810
00:35:54,679 --> 00:35:56,679
was the public account 100K News Guy.

811
00:35:57,639 --> 00:35:58,719
We looked into that account.

812
00:35:59,079 --> 00:36:00,280
The registered owner is Miao Yuzhu.

813
00:36:00,599 --> 00:36:01,719
Do you have proof

814
00:36:01,719 --> 00:36:03,840
that Li Mingyang is 100K News Guy?

815
00:36:04,880 --> 00:36:05,840
How can you prove

816
00:36:05,840 --> 00:36:07,159
that Li Mingyang smeared the police

817
00:36:07,360 --> 00:36:08,280
and not you?

818
00:36:11,679 --> 00:36:12,760
It's my fault.

819
00:36:13,760 --> 00:36:16,519
You don't have concrete proof that they scammed you,

820
00:36:17,280 --> 00:36:18,360
so there's no way

821
00:36:18,360 --> 00:36:20,360
to hold them criminally liable for this incident.

822
00:36:23,480 --> 00:36:24,199
Understood.

823
00:36:25,960 --> 00:36:28,639
Only my smashing the car can be prosecuted.

824
00:36:30,760 --> 00:36:32,559
Shen Leshui claims she was scammed,

825
00:36:32,880 --> 00:36:34,840
and that Li Mingyang orchestrated the fake news.

826
00:36:37,199 --> 00:36:37,639
Got it.

827
00:36:39,079 --> 00:36:40,119
What was Shen Leshui thinking?

828
00:36:40,800 --> 00:36:42,679
She sold so much of your footage to Li Mingyang,

829
00:36:43,239 --> 00:36:44,719
and now she turns around claiming she was tricked.

830
00:36:46,800 --> 00:36:48,920
What's going on in her head?

831
00:36:49,320 --> 00:36:50,960
Handle it however you need to.

832
00:36:51,239 --> 00:36:52,039
Don't worry about me.

833
00:36:55,639 --> 00:36:56,400
Miao Yuzhu is here.

834
00:36:56,679 --> 00:36:57,440
Come with me to question her.

835
00:37:00,400 --> 00:37:02,360
What does their fight have to do with me?

836
00:37:02,639 --> 00:37:03,719
Why did you bring me here?

837
00:37:09,159 --> 00:37:10,599
You run a public account, right?

838
00:37:11,280 --> 00:37:11,840
Yes.

839
00:37:12,239 --> 00:37:13,400
I have an account

840
00:37:13,400 --> 00:37:14,480
called Miao's Eloquence,

841
00:37:14,760 --> 00:37:17,000
and another called 100K News Guy.

842
00:37:17,360 --> 00:37:18,360
That's my media matrix.

843
00:37:18,679 --> 00:37:19,239
Is that illegal?

844
00:37:19,519 --> 00:37:20,519
It's not against the law, is it?

845
00:37:21,519 --> 00:37:23,000
Do you know what was posted

846
00:37:23,000 --> 00:37:23,840
on that account of yours?

847
00:37:24,599 --> 00:37:25,719
Trending news, of course.

848
00:37:26,400 --> 00:37:27,320
What happened at Lacheng Brewery

849
00:37:27,320 --> 00:37:28,559
was all over the news.

850
00:37:28,559 --> 00:37:30,239
Why can't I cover it on my account?

851
00:37:32,039 --> 00:37:32,639
Please, have a seat.

852
00:37:37,039 --> 00:37:38,960
I really didn't do anything wrong.

853
00:37:39,639 --> 00:37:41,519
If my posts violated any rules,

854
00:37:41,519 --> 00:37:42,800
